      "content": "On-demand geospatial processing of satellite and gridded climate datasets on Google Earth Engine. The Climate Engine REST API returns timeseries, map tiles (mapid), asynchronous raster exports, zonal statistics, pre-built reports, and dataset metadata over point coordinates and GeoJSON feature collections. Datasets include Landsat, Sentinel, MODIS, GRIDMET, ERA5, CHIRPS, and many more.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Climate Engine",
